 "story": "Calm, one hand resting on her bump. A jolt of unease \u2014 a small intake, head back \u2014 then the nausea comes: she lifts her hand to cover her mouth as her eyes squeeze shut; her throat clenches and a gag heaves her forward; she rides it out with two slow, controlled breaths through her hand; it passes \u2014 a long sigh as her hand comes back down to rest on her bump, and she softens, looking down at it with relief.",
